# Demo

This folder contains the demonstration materials for PharmaGuard AI.

## Demo Video

The demo video demonstrates the main user workflow, including:

1. Opening the PharmaGuard AI application.
2. Using the Signal Detection module.
3. Viewing PRR-based safety signals.
4. Exploring signal ranking, clustering, and explainability.
5. Using the Submission Readiness module.
6. Checking the synthetic CTD dossier.
7. Reviewing identified gaps and recommendations.

The demo video link is available in [`demo-video-link.txt`](demo-video-link.txt).

## Live Demo

The deployed application URL, if available, is provided in [`live-demo-url.txt`](live-demo-url.txt).

## Screenshots

Screenshots of the working application are stored in the [`screenshots/`](screenshots/) folder.
